      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW YAZ (6) scored two back then drifted back and missed the frame latest finishing a 3.5 lengths 4th at Shepparton (22.98). Looks the one to beat on her best form. WELLERMAN (1) was a big winner two back scoring by 0.8 lengths then got further back last time but came home hard into third and beaten 5 lengths at Healesville (17.25). Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to his name from five starts. Expecting another good run. ZIVA BALE (7) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (22.56) in a Rank Limit - Grade 5 at this track. Solid record here at the distance winning four races. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings four times from eight starts. Cannot be taken lightly. DUNACH FIREBALL (2) cannot be written off despite a miss here at his latest outing.",
